OL,3,GNEWSAThe giant pre-historic insect
OL,4,Afound by miners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two "irreplaceable" specimens,
OL,7,Fdubbed the "Bolsover Dragonflies", are
OL,8,Fthe only known example of the species
OL,9,Fever to be found, according to the
OL,10,Fmuseum.
